# Sample DNP3 traffic, generated by decoder.TestWriteSampleHex.
# Regenerate with: go test ./decoder -run TestWriteSampleHex -update

# master 1 resets the link to outstation 10
05 64 05 C0 0A 00 01 00 B1 AC 

# outstation 10 acknowledges
05 64 05 00 01 00 0A 00 2E DD 

# integrity poll: read classes 1, 2, 3 and 0
05 64 14 C4 0A 00 01 00 8F ED C0 C0 01 3C 02 06 
3C 03 06 3C 04 06 3C 01 06 8A 51 

# response: 4 binaries, 2 analogs, outstation restarted
05 64 1E 44 01 00 0A 00 C1 10 C0 C0 81 82 00 01 
02 00 00 03 81 01 81 01 1E 02 8D 86 00 00 01 01 
2C 01 01 90 01 7F FD 

# direct operate: trip the breaker at index 3
05 64 18 C4 0A 00 01 00 3D 3A C0 C1 05 0C 01 17 
01 03 41 01 E8 03 00 00 00 00 14 36 00 00 00 FF 
FF 
